     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Hello folks, <u></u>\r\n<u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">My colleague, Lourens Swanepoel and I have some funding for a post-doc based at the University of Venda in South Africa. The funding is not tied to any specific projects, but we have mountains\r\n of really neat data sets (eg, carnivore SCR, mammal community camera trapping, invertebrate sampling, audio recordings of bats and birds), and all focussed on south African ecology and conservation. We are looking for someone who has, or wants to develop their\r\n quantitative skills and there is a lot of scope to define the direction of the work. Given the amount to data you will have access to (and the ideas we have for questions we would like to ask) it is likely to be a productive post-doc.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">If you are interested in talking more about it, feel free to reach out to myself (<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cs...@st-andrews.ac.uk</a>) and Lourens (<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lourens....@univen.ac.za</a>).\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif\">Chris<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:black\">While I may be sending this email outside of my normal office hours, I have no expectation to receive a reply outside of\r\n yours.<u></u><u></u></span></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\"><u></u> <u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\">Chris Sutherland\r\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#000066\">(he/him/his)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">Reader</span></i><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">Centre for Research into Ecological &amp; Environmental Modelling<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">School of Mathematics and Statistics<br>\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">University of St Andrews</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:gray\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">W:\r\n<a href=\"https://www.sutherlandecology.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.sutherlandecology.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448085692000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SPM2TRuCxI-nWroOXT-5l\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">website</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:gray\">E:\r\n</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Garamond&quot;,serif;color:#0563c1\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1\">cs...@st-andrews.ac.uk</span></a></span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#0000cc\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><img border=\"0\" width=\"600\" height=\"120\" style=\"width:6.25in;min-height:1.25in\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/unmarked/attach/488fe26af2ec5/image001.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"lesson image\"><span><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
