     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\n*** Three hierarchical modeling email lists ***<br>\r\n(1) unmarked (this list): for questions specific to the R package unmarked<br>\r\n(2) SCR: for design and Bayesian or non-bayesian analysis of spatial capture-recapture<br>\r\n(3) HMecology: for everything else, especially material covered in the books by Royle &amp; Dorazio (2008), Kéry &amp; Schaub (2012), Kéry &amp; Royle (2016, 2021) and Schaub &amp; Kéry (2022)<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;unmarked&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/GVXPR06MB88531CC510FC7559A6DE9ADCE1D82%40GVXPR06MB8853.eurprd06.prod.outlook.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/GVXPR06MB88531CC510FC7559A6DE9ADCE1D82%2540GVXPR06MB8853.eurprd06.prod.outlook.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448085694000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0G8oTJKszGp8Wdi6cCTpWp\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/GVXPR06MB88531CC510FC7559A6DE9ADCE1D82%40GVXPR06MB8853.eurprd06.prod.outlook.com</a>.<br>\r\n</div></blockquote></div>\r\n"
